# rm385, the coal on the hinge (Docs/Design/84). Exported from ridgemere3 at revision 1: edit it in Atlas or the DM, or as a draft through tools/mantle_load.py.
mantle rm385
revision 1
state ready
dialect plain
accent broad light
tier standard
written_for rm_erland_plankwell
written_by codex
title the coal on the hinge
fits stage=adult|old
prefers job=servant drive=ambitious
traits temper=even talk=plain warmth=reserved humour=none honesty=sly piety=ordinary drive=ambitious
quirk keeps_a_coal_chip_for_marking_the_latch_that_squeaks
likes warm_bread dancing new_boots summer_evenings
dislikes bad_manners gulls
fears a_call_from_an_empty_room a_key_turned_too_late
hopes to_keep_a_house_in_perfect_quiet_order
topics work +0.6 dreams +0.3 pastimes +0.3 food +0.2 gossip -0.4
styles comfort=practical gossip=discreet refuse=civil tease=none
marks oath saying
persona #self.first# leaves a fine coal mark beside any hinge that squeaks, arrives quietly in well-kept boots, and has ambitions that never get written on the duty slate.

words
oath! = Bright brass black coal | Hinge in my pocket
saying! = Mark the fault while it speaks | Let the good hinge keep its own counsel
coalpoint = my pointed coal chip | a dark wedge of coal
smudge = a crescent of soot | a narrow black stroke
inneredge = the door's hidden edge | the jamb beside the hinge
polishrag = a soft cloth | a folded chamois
freshheel = the warm heel of bread | a piece from the oven end
turnshoe = a pair with polished toes | my good dancing shoes
guestmark = a chalk cross | a temporary little mark
saltbird = a gull perched by the glass | a white gull
lampfoot = the foot of a lamp | a lamp base
twobars = two bars of a dance | one quiet double turn
longsun = summer light lasting on stone | a pale late glow

any
opinion @1 houses against 1 : Serving a great House and belonging to one are two distinct arrangements.
opinion @1 dole against 1 : I'd rather earn a loaf with my hands if there's a day's work to be had.
opinion @1 watch against 1 : A patrol looking in at a lamp cannot see who trimmed it. I wish patrols remembered the limits of windows.
opinion @1 merchants against 1 : A little extra charge for a little extra wrapping has a way of becoming permanent.
opinion @1 strangers mixed 0 : One may open a door a convenient distance. The width is a matter of judgement.
opinion @1 festivals for 1 : Two clean shoes on a good floor make excellent use of a feast.
opinion @1 city for 1 : Ridgemere has doors enough for someone willing to consider the next one.

grown
line @1 greet : Enter the conversation at your convenience.
line @2 greet [pair.band=strangers] : There is space in the doorway to introduce yourself.
line @3 greet [here.time=dawn] : Morning. The brass shows rather well.
line @4 greet [here.time=dusk|night] : Evening. The hinges have fallen quiet.
line @1 greet.return : I heard the greeting before the latch.
line @2 greet.return [pair.band=friends|family] : A known voice is generally worth opening for.
line @3 greet.return [self.working=yes] : Come a little towards the lamp while my hands are occupied.
line @4 greet.return [here.time=dusk|night] : The hour favours a quiet exchange.
line @1 kin.open [pair.kin!=no] : Kin may use the convenient entrance.
line @1 again.open : I retained your place in the order of things.
line @1 hail [pair.band=friends] : Here in the patch of polished light!
line @1 farewell : Leave the door in a kindly humour.
line @1 farewell.return : And go with a comfortable tread.
line @1 react.news : I have an ear available for your report.
line @1 react.news.new : Nobody had brought that to this particular ear.
line @1 react.news.known : An earlier caller left much the same account.
line @1 react.news.doubt : Some part of the story has been polished too vigorously.
line @1 react.news.sorrow [topic.kind=death|loss|theft|assault|arrest|crime] : I would close a door softly on such news.
line @1 react.news.glad [topic.kind=marriage|birth|apprentice|succession|work] : That is an arrival worth a little extra light.
line @1 ask.how : Does the day open easily for you?
line @1 answer.how : Everything is running on a fairly quiet hinge.
line @1 thank : You have left the awkward part easier to manage.
line @1 deflect_thanks : A small adjustment can appear very generous.
line @1 sympathise : There is privacy here if it would serve.
line @1 reassure : You may leave a little space before answering.
line @1 decline : I must keep that hour available for an earlier engagement.
line @1 accept_decline : An answer freely given saves us both a wasted visit.
line @1 preclose : One last obligation waits behind my own door.
line @1 accept_preclose : I shall release you before either of us grows late.
scene hinge_mark
when topic=work|smalltalk
does tell.self / ask.detail / answer.detail
a : A hinge tells its fault just once sometimes. | #coalpoint.capitalize# does the work of a page.
b : You remember the sound? | Where do you write?
a : I remember the little black crescent I put beside it. | On #inneredge#. A caller sees only the good manners of the door.

scene coal_before
when topic=work self.job=servant
does tell.self / ask.detail / answer.detail
a : I put a fault right before the room fills up with advice. | An empty dining room has a rather precise music.
b : Does advice do harm? | What can disturb it?
a : It does lengthen the interval before anyone fetches oil. | A chair that rocks on the floor. I like to know the chair by sight.

scene future_keys
when topic=dreams
does confide / react.self / assess
a : I'd like to hold a set of keys that no wolf hears coming. | I would like an evening to end in good order at my own direction.
b : You'd line the ring with cloth? | You're ambitious.
a : Better. I'd plan the whole round before choosing the keys. | I mentioned an evening. My ambitions are a private concern.

scene warm_bread
when topic=food self.likes=warm_bread
does tell.self / ask.detail / answer.detail
a : Pass #freshheel# with nothing laid on it. | I like a loaf at the moment its crust starts ticking.
b : No butter? | Bread ticks?
a : When it's that warm the crumb supplies the luxury. | Faintly, like the last guests getting their coats.

scene dance_step
when topic=pastimes self.likes=dancing
does tell.self / ask.detail / answer.detail
a : A quiet heel can dance an unexpectedly lively figure. | I think #twobars# can redeem half a dull evening.
b : What marks the time? | And the other half?
a : The toes. A heel needs less attention than a dancing master supposes. | A tactful departure.

scene book_bright
when topic=smalltalk self.likes=new_boots
does tell.self / ask.detail / answer.detail
a : #turnshoe.capitalize# can make an old coat look deliberate. | Boots newly blacked ought to rest before stepping out.
b : Does it work the other way? | Do they tire?
a : Fine coats do little to explain a hole in a shoe. | No, but wet polish marks a carpet. The rest is for the carpet's sake.

scene summer_stone
when topic=season here.season=summer
does tell.self / ask.detail / answer.detail
a : In summer an outside stair holds its warmth longer than the air does. | #longsun.capitalize# lends ordinary brass an expensive look.
b : You sit there? | And after dark?
a : Just long enough for the last glow to reach my ankles. | After dark the polishing is my own affair.

scene gull_tray
when topic=animals self.dislikes=gulls
does tell.self / ask.detail / answer.detail
a : A gull sees very little difference between a tray and a supper invitation. | I reserve a cool look for a gull near any sill.
b : How do you explain? | Has it the desired effect?
a : I put a cloth over the tray and omit the explanations. | The gull remains unmoved. My manners remain intact.

scene good_manners
when topic=smalltalk self.dislikes=bad_manners
does give.opinion / react.self / assess
a : Knocking with the knob half turned is a curious understanding of courtesy. | A voice pitched to the back of a room needlessly involves the front.
b : Impatient callers? | What if the room is noisy?
a : Callers who would prefer the reply already decided. | Step nearer to the wolf whose ear you actually require.

scene heights_order
when topic=home self.quarter=heights
does tell.self / ask.detail / answer.detail
a : In the Heights even a gate sounds rather important. | From above a row of roofs looks most beautifully settled.
b : How can a gate manage that? | Not so inside?
a : Brass well fixed to costly wood. It still needs its hinges seen to. | Somebody must keep each roof's appearance from being a fiction.

scene family_silence
when topic=family self.married=yes
does tell.self / ask.detail / answer.detail
a : I'd take #self.spouse# to a dance where nobody needed me to see to the lamps. | For my #self.spouse_word# I would keep the warmest slice.
b : Would you still inspect the lamps? | As a courtesy?
a : Once. I should then put the light to better use. | A habit which gives me rather more pleasure than courtesy usually does.

scene scarce_wage
when topic=times world.times=hard|lean
does tell.self / ask.detail / answer.detail
a : It costs little to polish a buckle one already owns. | Sound stitching deserves more credit when coin runs short.
b : Does it help in lean times? | More than fine cloth?
a : A little polish can get a paw past a doubtful first impression. | Fine cloth with an open seam lacks a considerable virtue.

scene road_caller
when topic=travel world.wagons=late
does tell.self / ask.detail / answer.detail
a : A cart behind time imposes on the gate quite as much as the kitchen. | I'd leave room on a shelf for the late load.
b : Who waits there? | Even after dusk?
a : Anybody anxious about a delivery. One paw can wear a knob bright. | Room costs little if it has already been cleared.

scene polite_arrival
when topic=newcomer
does tell.self / ask.detail / answer.detail
a : I like an introduction somewhere neither party owns the door. | Offer a stranger the convenient chair.
b : What difference can that make? | The grand one?
a : You can tell whether the wolf likes the company or merely desires entrance. | Grand chairs may not be comfortable. I meant what I said.

scene bright_new
when topic=news world.news
does tell.news / react.self / assess
a : #world.news#. I received it by way of #world.news_from#. | My account is from #world.news_from#: #world.news#.
b : Has it changed in the telling? | Nothing from inside the doors?
a : Not in my keeping. I am careful about returning what is entrusted. | That is quite enough business for one open door.

scene other_side
when topic=gossip here.gossip=yes
does tell.gossip / react.self / assess
a : I have heard the talk in passing. It passed on without acquiring my assistance. | A private account went by with a familiar name attached.
b : Was it about the household? | Did you mark it down?
a : The pleasure of discretion lies in leaving that unanswered. | My coal is reserved for hinges. They do not take offence.

scene no_key
when topic=memories
does tell.self / ask.detail / answer.detail
a : Once I spent an hour studying a lock that belonged to no door. | I once thought possession of a key settled who might enter.
b : What was its purpose? | Now you doubt it?
a : A drawer had come apart. A little observation before considerable speculation would have helped. | There is usually a second door. Good houses are full of surprises.

scene small_change
when topic=dreams|home
does tell.self / ask.detail / answer.detail
a : Give me a room whose door stays exactly where I leave it. | A single shelf high enough for a private letter would serve me.
b : Open or shut? | Without a lock?
a : Either. I only ask that the choice stay mine. | Height discourages curiosity almost as effectively. Almost.

story pocket_cloud [topic=memories]
  : I let a very clean chair wear my jacket, quite forgetting its pocketful of coal.
  : The chair delivered me back a broad black crescent when I stood up.
  b : Who had to clean it?
  : A certain wolf with entirely too much interest in coal. The chair was beyond reproach.

story two_mirrors [topic=pastimes|memories]
  : I practised a dance in front of two bright serving trays propped on a shelf.
  : One warped tray bent my knee so far I feared for my balance.
  b : Did you stop practising?
  : I changed partners. The unbent tray was a kinder judge.

story letter_dry [topic=travel|memories]
  : I once wrapped a blank sheet for a journey more carefully than my lunch.
  : By the time I arrived the bread was wet but the sheet spotless.
  b : What did you write?
  : A timely reminder to put lunch inside the next wrapping.

rule @rub_hinge
when concept=bark self.working=yes
does aside
cooldown 8h
say A mark small enough for the jamb, large enough for my memory.

rule @step_late
when concept=bark here.time=dusk
does aside
cooldown 8h
say Enough daylight on the toe to show the polish.

rule @gull_lid
when concept=bark self.dislikes=gulls
does aside
cooldown 8h
say Cover the plate before the sky makes a claim.

rule @quiet_visit
when concept=bark here.time=night
does aside
cooldown 8h
say The latch is the final caller this evening.

dlg @1 resident.hub : There is a moment free before the next little necessity.
dlg @2 resident.hub [topic.meeting=known] : #topic.player#. Your previous call left a favourable impression.
dlg @3 resident.hub [here.time=night] : Within earshot, if you please. We can spare the night a disturbance.
dlg @4 resident.hub [pair.disposition=hostile|wary] : Stand there and the room will hear only what is needed.
dlg @1 resident.job [self.job=servant] : #self.trade_words.capitalize#. My days go to it, and I preserve the privacy the work requires.
dlg @2 resident.job : The most satisfactory work is seldom noticed at the instant of completion.
dlg @1 resident.news [world.news] : Here is what reached my door from #world.news_from#: #world.news#.
dlg @1 resident.gossip [here.gossip=yes] : Private talk travels far too readily in a caller's ears. I prefer to give it a quiet room.
dlg @1 resident.bye : I hope your own latch gives no trouble when you arrive.
graft resident.hub
choice Why hide the mark inside the jamb? -> inner_mark
node inner_mark
say A mark on the front would point out the fault to every caller. I wish to point it out to the one person carrying the oil.
choice Does the coal rub off? -> oil_mark
choice That is neatly arranged. -> hub
node oil_mark
say Certainly. A fault put right deserves a clean jamb to its credit. It is agreeable when very little evidence of one's industry remains.
choice I shall listen for the difference. -> hub
choice I will leave the hinge in peace. -> bye
